# 2) melt the upper half with the lower half frozen
variable     zmid equal (zlo+zhi)/2
region       up block INF INF INF INF ${zmid} INF units box
region       up block INF INF INF INF 60.7500000000001 INF units box
group        liq region up
5984 atoms in group liq
group        sol subtract all liq
6016 atoms in group sol
velocity     sol set 0 0 0
fix          freeze sol setforce 0 0 0
fix          melt liq nvt temp 2500 2500 0.2
run          ${neq}
run          500
